WEBVTT

00:01:34.270 --> 00:01:37.290
<i>We've set up a barricade around the 
building and the surrounding area,</i>

00:01:37.290 --> 00:01:39.980
<i>but we have not been able to 
identify any suspects.</i>

00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:44.030
<i>Currently we are continuing 
our investigation, over.</i>

00:01:58.970 --> 00:02:00.320
What's with him?

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:01.470
Who knows?

00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:03.890
Y-You can't be serious!

00:02:05.570 --> 00:02:06.720
It's true.

00:02:07.240 --> 00:02:11.750
The vice president of God Grave Tech 
Company, Riku Yuuki, was murdered.

00:02:12.860 --> 00:02:15.370
Maiasa Shimbun Digital Version

00:02:12.860 --> 00:02:15.370
G.G.T.C. Vice President

00:02:13.850 --> 00:02:14.990
But that's...

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:18.190
Yeah. He's Riku Rei's father.

00:02:15.370 --> 00:02:16.740
Murdered

00:02:21.820 --> 00:02:23.210
No...

00:02:26.680 --> 00:02:27.710
<i>Riku Rei!</i>

00:02:31.380 --> 00:02:36.390
Suigin Inherits a Legacy!

00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:46.680
Riku Rei already left.

00:02:48.320 --> 00:02:50.830
Sh-She left?

00:02:51.610 --> 00:02:54.700
Apparently there's a lot of paperwork for
 the funeral arrangements and other things,

00:02:55.350 --> 00:02:57.590
so people from the company 
came to pick her up.

00:02:57.900 --> 00:03:00.000
She said she'd be gone for a while.

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:06.740
Poor Riku Rei. She loved 
her father so much.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:10.040
Riku Rei...

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:17.720
Riku Yuuki Funeral Venue

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:23.010
Such a tragedy...

00:03:23.420 --> 00:03:26.530
To think that her only relative 
ended up like that.

00:03:27.090 --> 00:03:30.910
I heard that he had huge 
debts from various places.

00:03:30.910 --> 00:03:34.350
She's still so young and things are 
going to get very hard for her...

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:43.200
Accepting New Members for Grave Buster!

00:03:41.880 --> 00:03:43.200
<i>Riku Yuuki...</i>

00:03:43.630 --> 00:03:47.410
<i>He spent his whole life creating games,</i>

00:03:48.110 --> 00:03:51.710
<i>and working hard so that others
 could enjoy themselves.</i>

00:03:53.470 --> 00:04:00.300
I still can't believe that we parted 
ways in such a horrible manner.

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:06.300
Why did he have to face 
such a painful end?

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:12.270
We at the God Grave Tech 
Company will work with

00:04:12.270 --> 00:04:16.860
law enforcement to bring 
the culprit to justice,

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:20.220
and make them pay for their crimes.

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:29.950
<i>We will do everything we can to make sure that 
his final game, </i>Grave Buster<i>, is a success.</i>

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:33.750
Accepting New Members for "Grave Buster!"

00:04:42.350 --> 00:04:43.240
I...

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:48.360
know this person?

00:05:02.720 --> 00:05:05.050
I'm sorry for asking you to come.

00:05:05.730 --> 00:05:08.700
You were busy with work, weren't you?

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:12.040
Th-That's not a problem at...

00:05:14.390 --> 00:05:16.530
Um... I'm really sorry about...

00:05:17.240 --> 00:05:18.440
Thank you.

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:22.540
I'm fine now. More importantly...

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:25.700
There's something that 
I'd like you to have.

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:29.480
Suigin

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:28.960
For me?

00:05:33.170 --> 00:05:37.330
<i>Please give this package to Riku Suigin.</i>

00:05:38.110 --> 00:05:40.290
Riku Yuuki...

00:05:43.970 --> 00:05:46.700
Huh? Isn't this...

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:48.010
It's a Seabay.

00:05:48.510 --> 00:05:54.300
I think it's a console my father created 
specifically to play the new game.

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:59.010
But why did he want me to have it?

00:06:03.910 --> 00:06:06.540
<i>User identification sequence starting.</i>

00:06:15.360 --> 00:06:20.320
User Identification

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:20.880
<i>User name: Riku Suigin. Identification complete.</i>

00:06:18.070 --> 00:06:20.190
Complete

00:06:20.320 --> 00:06:23.200
Starting Up

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:23.200
Please Wait

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:22.560
<i>Starting up the system.</i>

00:06:23.780 --> 00:06:24.940
What...

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:26.460
What was that?

00:06:34.940 --> 00:06:38.060
But why did your father...

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:40.060
I don't know.

00:06:42.430 --> 00:06:44.640
You see, Suigin,

00:06:45.340 --> 00:06:47.910
I'm not my father's biological daughter.

00:06:47.910 --> 00:06:50.600
Huh? Th-That's...

00:06:50.600 --> 00:06:53.220
I don't remember anything,

00:06:53.910 --> 00:06:56.630
but, apparently, he took me in 
when I was very little.

00:06:57.330 --> 00:07:01.360
That's why I don't know 
anything about my father.

00:07:02.550 --> 00:07:05.340
I'm sorry for telling you 
something so strange.

00:07:05.340 --> 00:07:07.410
I-It's not strange!

00:07:08.350 --> 00:07:09.660
Riku Rei-san.

00:07:09.660 --> 00:07:10.700
Yes?

00:07:12.070 --> 00:07:13.950
You have a guest outside.

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:16.280
Yes, I'll see them.

00:07:16.510 --> 00:07:17.950
I'll be right back.

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:18.540
Okay.

00:07:24.550 --> 00:07:27.300
Starting Up

00:07:24.550 --> 00:07:27.300
Please Wait

00:07:31.580 --> 00:07:35.980
Are you Riku Yuuki's daughter?

00:07:47.950 --> 00:07:49.990
Welcome to <i>Grave Buster!</i>

00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:51.210
Grave...

00:07:51.580 --> 00:07:55.540
<i>The current wealth that you 
have saved up is displayed here.</i>

00:07:56.210 --> 00:07:57.410
Wealth?

00:07:57.750 --> 00:08:00.000
Riku Suigin

00:07:57.750 --> 00:08:00.000
Saved Wealth

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:07.340
One, ten, hundred, thousand...

00:08:08.720 --> 00:08:12.430
Saved Wealth

00:08:10.130 --> 00:08:12.420
T-Ten billion?!

00:08:12.990 --> 00:08:16.400
That's gotta be some kind of mistake...

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:16.940
Saved Wealth

00:08:16.940 --> 00:08:19.060
Recorded Audio

00:08:18.110 --> 00:08:19.060
<i>Ahem.</i>

00:08:23.760 --> 00:08:25.940
<i>Ah, testing, testing...</i>

00:08:26.990 --> 00:08:32.940
<i>Eh, ah... Suigin, I am 
leaving you this message.</i>

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:36.300
<i>My name is Riku Yuuki.</i>

00:08:36.300 --> 00:08:40.580
<i>I am the man who raised Riku Rei, 
but I am also your grandfather.</i>

00:08:41.130 --> 00:08:45.170
<i>Though I'm certain you don't remember me.</i>

00:08:45.530 --> 00:08:48.170
My... grandfather?

00:08:58.480 --> 00:08:59.890
Mission complete.

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:01.740
All the countermeasures are complete also.

00:09:02.490 --> 00:09:03.590
Well done.

00:09:04.440 --> 00:09:08.510
He ended up dying before telling me 
how to open up the tomb, though.

00:09:08.510 --> 00:09:13.790
It can't be helped. We just need 
to sort through his estate.

00:09:14.560 --> 00:09:17.260
There's no need to worry about that.

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:19.770
All of his assets have been eliminated,

00:09:19.770 --> 00:09:24.620
and all of his fake credit has 
been sent off to collectors.

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:29.750
Only death awaits those 
who go against Precious.

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:36.400
That is the will of our master,
 Dark Tiger-sama.

00:09:45.470 --> 00:09:49.980
<i>There is a reason I left 
this inheritance with you.</i>

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:54.430
<i>That's because I want you 
to use this money so that</i>

00:09:54.430 --> 00:09:57.430
<i>you and Riku Rei both can 
live happily ever after.</i>

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:13.040
Happiness fell into my 
lap way too suddenly!

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:17.470
Oh, stop, Riku Rei. Come on...

00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:20.050
I mean, my body is ready. 
My body is ready, but...

00:10:20.630 --> 00:10:22.350
<i>One other thing.</i>

00:10:22.350 --> 00:10:25.720
<i>Riku Rei and I are not biologically 
father and daughter.</i>

00:10:25.720 --> 00:10:30.990
<i>Her true parents were killed by the enemy.</i>

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:37.570
<i>Her parents and I were comrades
 with the same purpose.</i>

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:40.660
<i>However, the enemy got to them, 
and they were eliminated,</i>

00:10:41.120 --> 00:10:43.980
<i>leaving a very young Riku Rei behind.</i>

00:10:49.150 --> 00:10:55.730
<i>I took her in and raised her while 
protecting her from the enemy.</i>

00:10:56.210 --> 00:10:57.710
But that's...

00:10:58.300 --> 00:10:59.740
Please stop!

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:03.960
If you have any complaints, take it up 
with your dead father for leaving the debt.

00:11:03.960 --> 00:11:08.110
My father wouldn't have left 
that much debt! Let me go!

00:11:08.110 --> 00:11:11.180
We'll hear you out back at the office.

00:11:11.180 --> 00:11:12.460
Please stop!

00:11:12.460 --> 00:11:13.790
Stop struggling, damn it!

00:11:14.190 --> 00:11:15.470
Riku Rei!

00:11:18.100 --> 00:11:20.600
<i>Please use this inheritance 
that I've left you</i>

00:11:20.600 --> 00:11:23.620
<i>and protect her from the enemy.</i>

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:24.820
Hold it!

00:11:25.320 --> 00:11:26.540
What?

00:11:27.010 --> 00:11:29.740
Don't touch her!

00:12:59.930 --> 00:13:04.920
Next Time
Suigin Pledges Himself to Riku Rei!

00:13:02.200 --> 00:13:03.600
The Silver Guardian!
